  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Just_Another_Library/BH_Just_Another_Library_header.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"450\"></p><h2><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Just_Another_Library/BH_Just_Another_Library_description.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1401\" height=\"151\"></strong></span></h2><ul>\n<li>JustAnotherLibraryMod 是我幾乎所有<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/christianbutnot/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">模組與模組包</a>的基礎。凡是我創作的內容，都需要安裝此模組。</li>\n<li>它目前新增了自訂物品類型、工具類型、武器類型，所有這些都可以透過將此函式庫作為儲存庫來存取。</li>\n<li>包含自訂的工具等級，例如改良的原版等級（木頭、石頭、鐵、鑽石等）、自訂等級（綠寶石、石英、黑曜石），以及更多（主要圍繞於我在所有模組中的自訂工具）。</li>\n<li>包含適用於我所有模組的護甲材料，以及更多。</li>\n<li>提供多種標籤，可用於所有自訂物品類型。</li>\n<li>實作了鐮鍬、長矛、小刀、剪刀等更多武器/工具類型，您只需正確建立它們的物品模型，即可按照您想要的方式顯示（請參考 <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-some-more-spears\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">JustSomeMoreSpears</a> 的例子！）</li>\n</ul><p><a href=\"https://github.com/christianbutnot/justanotherlibrarymod/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Just_Another_Library/BH_Just_Another_Library_developers.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1401\" height=\"151\"></strong></a></p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/VsWATPgvzx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Just_Another_Library/BH_Just_Another_Library_discord.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"151\"></strong></a></p><p><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Just_Another_Library/BH_Just_Another_Library_twitter.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></strong></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fprogression\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Just_Another_Library/BH_Just_Another_Library_promo2.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"251\"></strong></a></p>",
